  "limitations": [
    "Conditional tweet-level historical benchmark; not a validated social coordination module.",
    "Label 1 means targeted by historical influence-operation replies (at least five IO replies), not that the target is a bot or malicious actor.",
    "Controls are selected posts with at least five replies, not ordinary or independently verified benign traffic.",
    "Actor and campaign group IDs are unavailable; actor/campaign leakage is unverified. This is not a genuinely hidden test.",
    "Historical heuristic labels do not establish current coordination, attribution, bot identity or maliciousness.",
    "One predeclared mean_cosine stump is selected on train only; validation/test are reported separately, with no tuning on them.",
    "Descriptive medians use all deduplicated posts; they do not select features or thresholds."
  ]
